      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>THE ORGANIZATION FOR PROFESSIONAL ASTROLOGY (OPA) IS A 501(C)(6) NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION THAT ADVANCES THE CAUSE OF PROFESSIONAL ASTROLOGY BY HELPING STUDENTS AND PRACTICING ASTROLOGERS GET THE INFORMATION, INSIGHTS, AND EXPERIENCES THEY NEED TO FOSTER THEIR UNDERSTANDING OF ASTROLOGY, AND LAUNCH AND ENHANCE THEIR ASTROLOGY PRACTICES.OPA ASSISTS ASTROLOGERS IN IMPROVING BOTH PERSONALLY AND PROFESSIONALLY, AND DEFINES AND MAINTAINS PROFESSIONAL STANDARDS FOR THE RESPONSIBLE USE OF ASTROLOGY. OPA IS DEDICATED TO ESTABLISHING ASTROLOGY AS AN EMINENT SPIRITUAL, PSYCHOLOGICAL AND HOLISTIC TOOL OF UNDERSTANDING. OPA SUPPORTS ASTROLOGY IN ITS DIFFERENT STREAMS, AND ADVOCATES TOLERANCE, ETHICAL PRACTICE, HIGH STANDARDS, AND CONTINUAL GROWTH OF THE PROFESSION. OPA OFFERS COMPLETELY UNIQUE PROGRAMS AND PUBLICATIONS TO FOSTER EDUCATION, COMMUNITY, AND PROFESSIONAL PRACTICE IN THE FIELD OF ASTROLOGY.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>OPA is a membership-based nonprofit organization that advances professional astrology through its distinctive certification program that evaluates practicing astrologers' management capabilities, ethical standards, and practical skills. Their certification, open to all astrological orientations, provides practitioners with a respected credential that demonstrates their competence and quality of service, while members receive significant discounts on workshops, conferences, and retreats, making professional development more accessible and supporting their mission to enhance astrologers' expertise and credibility. The organization supports certified astrologers through active promotion while using membership dues and certification fees to fund a 501(C)(3) nonprofit OPA International Astrology Foundation, Inc. dedicated to expanding accessible, high-quality astrological education. Through these efforts, OPA works to make astrology more professional, credible, and sustainable as a practice while ensuring global access to valuable and effective astrological services.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
